  "prefLabel": "Plc 1102.07 Practice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1102.07 “Practice” means “practice” as defined in RSA 328-H:2, VI, namely, “the application of a system of structured touch therapies which includes reflexology, structural integration, or Asian bodywork therapy.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36 (formerly Plc 1102.10)",
